# Trial of Duty (Q212), a second class-change trial, played by a level 35 Knight wearing an
# Old Knight's Sword of its own (a knight must hold one to slay Sir Herod's spirit), every
# script roll pinned to 0: Hannavalt starts it and pays the level 35 set's Dimensional
# Diamonds (45 for a Knight, once per character); Sir Aron gives his sword, a Skeleton
# Marauder calls Sir Herod's spirit and the spirit's death gives the Knight's Tear; Sir Kiel
# asks for the ten report pieces of the strains, then hands over the Mirror of Orpic; a
# Hangman Tree calls Sir Talianus' spirit, which confesses and leaves; Silvershadow wants
# twenty Militas articles of the Leto Lizardmen; Dustin sends the knight after Athebaldt's
# bones on the Breka Orc Overlords, Sir Collin takes the saint's ashes; Hannavalt hands over
# the Mark of Duty and completes the quest; then relog. Expectations replay the reference
# trace of this scenario.
trace internal/gameserver/script/testdata/oracle/scenarios/q212_trial_of_duty.golden
character Paladin 35
class 4
equip 3027
random always 0
script quest.Q212_TrialOfDuty
item 2633 2634 2635 2636 2637 2638 2639 2640 2641 2642 2643 2644 2645 2646 3027 7562
page villagemaster/30109.htm
page trainer/30116.htm
page default/30311.htm
page default/30653.htm
page default/30654.htm
page default/30655.htm
page default/30656.htm
page script/quest/Q212_TrialOfDuty/
npc hannavalt 30109 VillageMasterFighter 10 0 0
npc dustin 30116 Trainer -10 0 0
npc collin 30311 Folk 0 10 0
npc aron 30653 Folk 0 -10 0
npc kiel 30654 Folk 20 20 0
npc silvershadow 30655 Folk -20 20 0
npc talianus 30656 Folk 20 -20 0
npc marauder 20190 Monster 40 0 0
npc herod 27119 Monster -40 0 0
npc strain 20200 Monster 0 40 0
npc hangman 20144 Monster 0 -40 0
npc lizardman 20577 Monster 40 40 0
npc breka 20270 Monster -40 -40 0

# Hannavalt: a Knight of level 35 may start; the first trial of the set pays the diamonds,
# which turns the accept page into 30109-04a.htm.
action hannavalt
action hannavalt
  S ActionFailed
  S NpcHtmlMessage obj=hannavalt item=0 page=villagemaster/30109.htm
  S ActionFailed
bypass npc_{hannavalt}_Quest
  S NpcHtmlMessage obj=hannavalt item=0 page=script/quest/Q212_TrialOfDuty/30109-03.htm
  S ActionFailed
  S ActionFailed
  state Q212_TrialOfDuty CREATED
bypass Quest Q212_TrialOfDuty 30109-04.htm
  S QuestList 212:0x80000001
  S ExShowQuestMark quest=212
  S PlaySound type=0 file=ItemSound.quest_accept bind=0 obj=0 loc=0,0,0 delay=0
  S SystemMessage id=53 3:7562 6:45
  S NpcHtmlMessage obj=hannavalt item=0 page=script/quest/Q212_TrialOfDuty/30109-04a.htm
  S ActionFailed
  Q upsert Q212_TrialOfDuty | <state> | STARTED
  Q upsert Q212_TrialOfDuty | <cond> | 1
  M set secondClassChange35 | true
  items 7562=45

